{"filePath":"/home/runner/opencode-agentic-engine/src/core/llm.ts","oldString":"  /**
   * 🔴 THE ONLY LLM CALL PATH.
   *
   * Every LLM call goes through OpenCode SDK — NO direct external API calls.
